  sig=untyped string
  doc=KindBrief marks a task whose objective is an autonomous MORNING_BRIEF run\n(ORACLE task 5.4). The normal boot reaper (Running) EXCLUDES these — a\nbrief must never resume on the full interactive/money surface — and the\ndedicated brief-resume path (RunningKind) picks them up on the restricted\nbrief surface instead. An empty Kind is an ordinary interactive task.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/task/store.go

