  sig=func (s *Store) BeginKind(convID, runID, objective, kind string)
  doc=BeginKind is Begin with an explicit task kind ("" = interactive; KindBrief =\nautonomous morning brief). The kind steers the boot reaper: an interactive\ntask resumes on the full surface (Running), a brief on the restricted brief\nsurface (RunningKind) — a brief must never resume on the money surface.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/task.Store
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/task/store.go

